9\"}]}]},{\"b\":\"[956,778][992,814]\",\"a11y\":\"New Paint\",\"rid\":\"refine-palette-new\"}]}]},{\"b\":\"[0,834][1032,1376]\",\"c\":[{\"b\":\"[0,834][1032,2519]\",\"c\":[{\"b\":\"[340,854][1012,2499]\",\"rid\":\"refine-guide-page\",\"c\":[{\"b\":\"[340,854][392,906]\",\"a11y\":\"Hand Drawing A Line\",\"rid\":\"hand.draw\"},{\"b\":\"[406,867][519,893]\",\"a11y\":\"The Basics\"},{\"b\":\"[340,920][1012,1029]\",\"a11y\":\"A picture in Refine is made of three things. Ink is the lines you see. Cells are the areas the picture is divided into, and each cell has a number. Paint is the color of a cell, and all the cells of one paint share its number. Most cells are bounded by lines; a border with no line shows as a dashed edge while you work with cells, and isn\u2019t drawn on the finished picture. Refine\u2019s own messages call a cell an \u201carea\u201d.\"},{\"b\":\"[340,1043][550,1063]\",\"a11y\":\"The tools are in five groups:\"},{\"b\":\"[340,1089][345,1094]\",\"a11y\":\"Circle\",\"rid\":\"circle.fill\"},{\"b\":\"[356,1077][832,1098]\",\"a11y\":\"Ink: the Pen, Shapes, Bend Line, the Eraser and the Line Eraser\"},{\"b\":\"[340,1117][345,1122]\",\"a11y\":\"Circle\",\"rid\":\"circle.fill\"},{\"b\":\"[356,1106][794,1126]\",\"a11y\":\"Cells: Select, Cell Edge, Merge, Move Edge and Make Cell\"},{\"b\":\"[340,1146][345,1151]\",\"a11y\":\"Circle\",\"rid\":\"circle.fill\"},{\"b\":\"[356,1134][897,1155]\",\"a11y\":\"Paint: the Bucket, the Paint Brush, the Eyedropper, Edit Paint and Looks\"},{\"b\":\"[340,1174][345,1179]\",\"a11y\":\"Circle\",\"rid\":\"circle.fill\"},{\"b\":\"[356,1163][542,1183]\",\"a11y\":\"Numbers: Move Number\"},{\"b\":\"[340,1203][345,1208]\",\"a11y\":\"Circle\",\"rid\":\"circle.fill\"},{\"b\":\"[356,1191][575,1212]\",\"a11y\":\"See: Writing and Try Painting\"},{\"b\":\"[340,1226][1012,1334]\",\"a11y\":\"On iPad they all stand in a column at the side; on iPhone, pick a group and then a tool. Whatever options a tool has appear along the bottom, and so does the palette: a swatch for each paint, with its number, and a color wheel at the end for a new one. Each tool is made for ink, cells, paint or numbers, though one change can lead to another: erase the line between two cells, and they become one.\"},{\"b\":\"[340,1358][628,1379]\",\"a11y\":\"When a change seems to do nothing\"}]}]},{\"b\":\"[999,834][1029,1344]\",\"a11y\":\"Vertical scroll bar, 4 pages\",\"txt\":\"0%\",\"val\":\"0%\",\"c\":[{\"b\":\"[1026,837][1029,984]\"}]},{\"b\":\"[999,834][1029,1344]\",\"a11y\":\"Vertical scroll bar, 4 pages\",\"txt\":\"0%\",\"val\":\"0%\",\"c\":[{\"b\":\"[1026,837][1029,984]\"}]}]}]}]}]}]},{\"b\":\"[0,0][1032,1376]\",\"a11y\":\"Toolbar\",\"rid\":\"Toolbar\",\"c\":[{\"b\":\"[0,0][1032,1376]\"}]}]}]},{\"b\":\"[0,0][1032,1376]\",\"a11y\":\"Toolbar\",\"rid\":\"Toolbar\",\"c\":[{\"b\":\"[0,0][1032,1376]\"}]}]}]},{\"b\":\"[0,0][1032,1376]\",\"c\":[{\"b\":\"[0,0][1032,1376]\"}]}]}]}]}]}]},{\"b\":\"[0,0][1032,1376]\",\"c\":[{\"b\":\"[0,0][1032,1376]\",\"c\":[{\"b\":\"[0,0][1032,1376]\"}]}]}]},{\"b\":\"[0,0][1032,32]\"},{\"b\":\"[0,0][1032,32]\",\"c\":[{\"b\":\"[0,0][1032,32]\",\"c\":[{\"b\":\"[0,0][1032,32]\",\"c\":[{\"b\":\"[25,11][167,21]\",\"c\":[{\"b\":\"[25,7][83,24]\",\"a11y\":\"11:56\u202fPM\"},{\"b\":\"[93,7][167,24]\",\"a11y\":\"Tue Nov 10\"}]},{\"b\":\"[49,7][67,25]\"},{\"b\":\"[177,11][318,21]\",\"c\":[{\"b\":\"[177,0][318,32]\",\"c\":[{\"b\":\"[177,0][318,32]\",\"c\":[{\"b\":\"[177,0][305,32]\",\"a11y\":\"Paint by Moonlight\"}]}]}]},{\"b\":\"[238,7][256,25]\"},{\"b\":\"[326,11][1006,21]\",\"c\":[{\"b\":\"[955,8][973,24]\",\"txt\":\"SSID, 3 of 3 Wi-Fi bars\",\"val\":\"SSID, 3 of 3 Wi-Fi bars\",\"rid\":\"3 of 3 Wi-Fi bars\",\"c\":[{\"b\":\"[954,9][973,22]\",\"a11y\":\"Wi-Fi\",\"rid\":\"wifi\"}]},{\"b\":\"[977,9][1006,22]\",\"a11y\":\"100% battery power\",\"txt\":\"Not charging\",\"val\":\"Not charging\"}]},{\"b\":\"[964,7][982,25]\"}]}]}]}]}"
